@ApiClinica_HostAddress = http://localhost:5070

### Liveness (não precisa de token)
GET {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/alive
Accept: application/json

### Login como Admin (criado automaticamente na subida da API)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@clinica.com",
  "senha": "Admin@123"
}

### Registrar usuário comum
POST {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Usuário Comum",
  "email": "comum@clinica.com",
  "senha": "Comum@123"
}

### Login como usuário comum
# @name loginComum
POST {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "comum@clinica.com",
  "senha": "Comum@123"
}

### Listar pacientes sem token (espera 401)
GET {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/pacientes
Accept: application/json

### Listar pacientes (Admin)
GET {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/pacientes
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

### Criar paciente (qualquer usuário logado)
POST {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/pacientes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginComum.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "nome": "Maria Souza",
  "email": "maria@exemplo.com",
  "telefone": "(47) 98888-7777",
  "dataNasc": "1990-05-12",
  "cpf": "123.456.789-09"
}

### Criar médico
POST {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/medicos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "nome": "Dr. Carlos Lima",
  "email": "carlos@clinica.com",
  "telefone": "(47) 3344-5566",
  "crm": "12345/SC"
}

### Criar consulta
POST {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/consultas
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "pacienteId": 1,
  "medicoId": 1,
  "dataHora": "2026-12-15T10:00:00"
}

### PATCH como usuário comum (espera 403)
PATCH {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/pacientes/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginComum.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "nome": "Maria S."
}

### PATCH como Admin (espera 200)
PATCH {{ApiClinica_HostAddress}}/api/pacientes/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "nome": "Maria S."
}

###
